Claude CLI (control_request)
    ↓
WebSocket Server (ws.ts)
    ↓ (stores input in pendingControlRequests)
    ↓ (relays to browser)
Browser (use-websocket hook)
    ↓ (transforms to ChatMessage with controlRequest)
Chat Component
    ↓
ControlRequest Card (shows Allow/Deny buttons)
    ↓ (user clicks Allow/Deny)
respondToControl callback
    ↓ (sends control_response)
WebSocket Server
    ↓ (retrieves stored input, builds response)
Claude CLI
```

All file paths are absolute paths starting from `/Users/chiu.fyi/thos/`.

